Subject: [PATCH] Prepare saved terminal host context before closing unloaded
 sessions

Reuse standard connection/modal and Project factories without opening or activating a workspace. Load saved roots for terminal settings, recheck live and pending terminal ownership after setup, and preserve metadata on cancellation/failure. Cover local closure from a remote workspace and remote closure from a local workspace with no UI activation. Keep existing unreachable-host refusal assertions.
